                                      class="em-text em-rule"
                                      style='font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;margin:0;padding:16px 0 0;border-top:2px solid #1A1C1E;color:#1A1C1E;font-family:Alexandria, "Noto Sans Arabic", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Tahoma, "Geeza Pro", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:500;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0'>
                                      <span dir="auto" translate="no"
                                        >Ahmed Alzubairi</span
                                      >
                                    </p>
                                  </td>
