                                      class="em-text"
                                      style='font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px;color:#1A1C1E;font-family:Alexandria, "Noto Sans Arabic", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Tahoma, "Geeza Pro", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:400;overflow-wrap:anywhere;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0'>
                                      sample-memberName added a recommendation
                                      on the request for the document
                                      “sample-documentTitle”.
                                    </p>
                                    <p
                                      class="em-text"
                                      style='font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px;color:#1A1C1E;font-family:Alexandria, "Noto Sans Arabic", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Tahoma, "Geeza Pro", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:400;overflow-wrap:anywhere;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0'>
                                      Open the dashboard to read it and decide.
                                    </p>
                                    <table
                                      align="center"
                                      width="100%"
                                      border="0"
                                      cellpadding="0"
                                      cellspacing="0"
                                      role="presentation"
                                      style="margin:8px 0 32px">
                                      <tbody>
                                        <tr>
                                          <td>
                                            <a
                                              href="https://site.example/en/dashboard"
                                              class="em-button"
                                              style='line-height:1.5;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;padding:12px 24px;background-color:#0E5C61;border-radius:0;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:Alexandria, "Noto Sans Arabic", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Tahoma, "Geeza Pro", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;padding-top:12px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:24px'
                                              target="_blank"
                                              ><span
                                                ><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%;mso-text-raise:18" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span
